  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="12">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IVEg">IV Eg</ref> 12</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Þonne wille ic þæt stande mid Denum swa gode laga swa hy betste geceosen; ⁊ ic heom á geþafode ⁊ geðafian wille, swa lange swa me lif gelæst, for eowrum hyldum þe ge me symble cyddon.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Further, it is my will that the Danes continue to observe the best constitution which they can determine upon. I have always granted you such a concession and will continue to do so, as long as my life lasts, because of the loyalty which you have constantly professed to me.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Þonne will ic, þæt stande mid Denum swa gode laga swa hy betste geceosen, ⁊ ic heom á geþafode ⁊ geþafian wille, swa lange swa me lif gelæst, for eowrum hyldum, þe ge me symble cyddon.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
